    {
      "anchor": "resizing",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Resizing"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "post--drives-uuid-action-?do=resize",
      "kind": "operation",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/2.0/drives/{uuid}/action/?do=resize"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "resizing",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Note that the resize action is a full definition update (it can update even name and metadata), so a full definition should be provided to this call."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "resize-checks-and-conditions",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Resize Checks and Conditions"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "resize-checks-and-conditions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Resize is permitted only when the drive is in an active state (MOUNTED or UNMOUNTED) or in a STAGING state."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "resize-checks-and-conditions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "The new size must be within the minimum and maximum limits specified by the Capabilities API call."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "resize-checks-and-conditions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "The system verifies that the resized ephemeral drive can fit within the existing available space in the cloud."
    },
    {
      "anchor": "resize-checks-and-conditions",
      "kind": "prose",
      "text": "Example:"
    },
    {
      "anchor": "resize-checks-and-conditions",
      "classification": "request-example",
      "kind": "code",
      "method": "POST",
      "original_sha256": "46d6eb5be894f0daf46188ed786513c94fa448eb65257667987f1b8393b01346",
      "path": "/api/2.0/drives/df170528-c34d-4009-a806-c7d85c78cad8/action/?do=resize"
    },
    {
